{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storybookjs/storybook/issues/9778","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storybookjs/storybook","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storybookjs/storybook/issues/9778/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storybookjs/storybook/issues/9778/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storybookjs/storybook/issues/9778/events","html_url":"https://github.com/storybookjs/storybook/issues/9778","id":561122325,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWU1NjExMjIzMjU=","number":9778,"title":"Why are lodash imports as named imports? This adds the entire lodash to the dist","user":{"login":"lgraziani2712","id":15050200,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MDUwMjAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15050200?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lgraziani2712","html_url":"https://github.com/lgraziani2712","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lgraziani2712/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lgraziani2712/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lgraziani2712/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lgraziani2712/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lgraziani2712/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lgraziani2712/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lgraziani2712/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lgraziani2712/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lgraziani2712/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":343576454,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNDM1NzY0NTQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storybookjs/storybook/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"EB484F","default":true,"description":null},{"id":1336341211,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzM2MzQxMjEx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storybookjs/storybook/labels/addon:%20docs","name":"addon: docs","color":"fbca04","default":false,"description":""}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":9,"created_at":"2020-02-06T16:22:46Z","updated_at":"2020-02-08T12:05:50Z","closed_at":"2020-02-07T16:02:37Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**Describe the bug**\r\nLodash is being imported as if was an es-module, but it isn't, so is adding me the entire lodash/lodash.js file plus all the specific modules I'm importing.\r\n\r\n**To Reproduce**\r\nSteps to reproduce the behavior:\r\n\r\n1. Generate stats when building.\r\n2. Open webpack stats with https://webpack.github.io/analyse\r\n3. Go to the modules section and search \"lodash/lodash.js\". Click in the green button to analyze that specific module.\r\n4. See how many storybook modules are importing lodash as a es-module.\r\n\r\n**Expected behavior**\r\nTo not have the entire lodash module plus each lodash function in the final bundle.\r\n\r\n**Screenshots**\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/15050200/73956275-796a3100-48e3-11ea-8918-f3b0abd65c08.png)\r\n\r\n**Code snippets**\r\nThis could be solved by importing each lodash modules specifically. E.g:\r\n\r\nInstead of:\r\n\r\n```js\r\nimport { isNil } from 'lodash';\r\n```\r\n\r\nWould be:\r\n\r\n```js\r\nimport isNil from 'lodash/isNil';\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Additional context**\r\nI would gladly fix it in a PR if its OK.\r\n\r\nThank you!\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"shilman","id":488689,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODY4OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/488689?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman","html_url":"https://github.com/shilman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/following